{"book":"data","bookTitle":"Data handling","concept":4,"title":"Mode, median and range","grades":"Grades 6–7","goal":"I can find the mode, median and range of a data set.","teach":"The <b>mode</b> is the value that occurs most often. The <b>median</b> is the middle value when the data is in order; with an even number of values it is halfway between the middle two. The <b>range</b> is the largest value minus the smallest; it shows the spread.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:689px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 530 44\"><rect x=\"2.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"37.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><rect x=\"78.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"113.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><rect x=\"154.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"189.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><rect x=\"230.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"265.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">6</text><rect x=\"306.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"341.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">8</text><rect x=\"382.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"417.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">9</text><rect x=\"458.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"493.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">13</text></svg></span><div class=\"cap\">Ordered: mode 5, median 6 (the 4th of 7 values), range 13 − 3 = 10.</div></div>","ex":{"q":"Find the median of 4, 9, 2, 7, 10, 6.","steps":["Order them: 2, 4, 6, 7, 9, 10.","There are 6 values, so the middle two are 6 and 7.","Median = (6 + 7) ÷ 2 = 6,5."]},"watch":"Put the data in order before you find the median.","qs":[{"text":"Find the mode of 2, 4, 4, 5, 7, 7, 7, 9.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Mode","a":"7","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Most often.","steps":"1. Rule: the mode is the value that appears most often.<br>2. 7 appears three times, more than any other value.<br>3. Mode = 7"},{"text":"Find the median of 21, 17, 25, 19, 23, 16, 20.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Median","a":"20","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Order: 16, 17, 19, …","steps":"1. Rule: the median is the middle value once the data is in order; with an even number of values, it is the mean of the two middle values.<br>2. In order: 16, 17, 19, 20, 21, 23, 25<br>3. There are 7 values, so the middle one is the 4th: 20."},{"text":"Find the median of 3, 8, 5, 10.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Median","a":"6.5","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"(5 + 8) ÷ 2","steps":"1. Rule: the median is the middle value once the data is in order; with an even number of values, it is the mean of the two middle values.<br>2. In order: 3, 5, 8, 10<br>3. Two middle values: (5 + 8) ÷ 2 = 13 ÷ 2 = 6,5"}]}